---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于" description="关于 Daily Fun">
  <h1 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary">关于 Daily Fun</h1>
  <div class="prose prose-sm max-w-none text-text-secondary">
    <p class="mb-4 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      <strong class="text-text-primary">Daily Fun</strong> 是一个适合摸鱼、放松、每天打开浏览几分钟的轻量级网站。
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4">这里收集每日搞笑图片、文字、GIF、Meme 和趣味短句。</p>

    <h2 class="mb-3 mt-6 text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">内容分类</h2>
    <ul class="mb-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-1">
      <li>梗图 — 网络热梗图片</li>
      <li>笑话 — 冷笑话、段子</li>
      <li>趣句 — 毒鸡汤、神回复、弱智吧语录</li>
      <li>动图 — 搞笑 GIF</li>
      <li>趣图 — 翻车照、巧合照</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mb-3 mt-6 text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">像素小猫</h2>
    <p class="mb-3">页面右下角有一只像素小猫，它不只是装饰——点击可以赚取猫粮，还有完整的经济养成系统：</p>
    <ul class="mb-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-1">
      <li>三层货币：猫粮 / 猫条 / 猫罐头，可兑换升级</li>
      <li>自动产出 + 点击加成 + 产出倍率，离线也有收益</li>
      <li>9种随机事件（老鼠、下雨、礼物、蝴蝶、月光等）</li>
      <li>心情系统：心情影响产出效率，猫薄荷/毛绒玩具恢复心情</li>
      <li>6种外观装饰 + 3种抽奖专属外观（彩虹猫、幽灵猫、火焰猫）+ 星际猫</li>
      <li>3个猫咪技能：精准捕猎、幸运体质、优质睡眠</li>
      <li>5级猫咪地产：小窝→猫薄荷园→猫粮商店→猫咪城堡→猫咪星球</li>
      <li>猫咪抽奖：普通/豪华抽奖，碎片收集解锁专属外观</li>
      <li>每日签到 + 每日任务，连续签到递增奖励</li>
      <li>28个成就，从"初次打工"到"星际猫神"</li>
      <li>8级猫咪等级：小奶猫 → 学徒猫 → 打工猫 → 精英猫 → 猫老板 → 猫皇 → 猫神 → 猫仙</li>
      <li>存档导出/导入，数据安全无忧</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mb-3 mt-6 text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">技术栈</h2>
    <div class="mb-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-3 text-center">
        <div class="mb-1 text-lg">🚀</div>
        <div class="font-semibold text-text-primary">Astro 7</div>
        <div class="text-xs opacity-60">静态站点生成</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-3 text-center">
        <div class="mb-1 text-lg">🎨</div>
        <div class="font-semibold text-text-primary">Tailwind CSS 4</div>
        <div class="text-xs opacity-60">原子化样式</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-3 text-center">
        <div class="mb-1 text-lg">📘</div>
        <div class="font-semibold text-text-primary">TypeScript</div>
        <div class="text-xs opacity-60">类型安全</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-3 text-center">
        <div class="mb-1 text-lg">📦</div>
        <div class="font-semibold text-text-primary">Content Collections</div>
        <div class="text-xs opacity-60">结构化内容管理</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-3 text-center">
        <div class="mb-1 text-lg">🐱</div>
        <div class="font-semibold text-text-primary">Canvas 像素画</div>
        <div class="text-xs opacity-60">小猫渲染引擎</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-3 text-center">
        <div class="mb-1 text-lg">💾</div>
        <div class="font-semibold text-text-primary">localStorage</div>
        <div class="text-xs opacity-60">本地存档持久化</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="mb-3 mt-6 text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">部署</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">三平台同步部署，完全免费：</p>
    <ul class="mb-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-1">
      <li><strong>Cloudflare Pages</strong> — 主站，全球 CDN 加速</li>
      <li><strong>Vercel</strong> — 备用站</li>
      <li><strong>GitHub Pages</strong> — 备用站</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mb-3 mt-6 text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">开源</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">本项目代码开源，欢迎交流。</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
